    "display_name": "Penalty Shootout",
    "bubble_choice_description": "Predict how many penalty kicks a soccer player will make.",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://images.code.org/3110b2a5094f79d5652ecff9584d3642-planet_fox-football-7095188.jpg",
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "Predict the percentage of penalty kicks a soccer player make, based on the number of years they've practiced.\r\n\r\n**☑️ Do This:**\r\n- Complete the `loss` function. Prompt AI to help you if you need it.\r\n- Run your code.\r\n- Test your loss function on both the `predict_kicks_1` model and the `predict_kicks_2` model by changing which model is given to `visualize_model`. Compare the loss calculated for both models.\r\n",
